// EE-AOC.exe resources: the retail .rsrc (the installed exe's is community-edited), as resource script source.
// tools/exe_fulllink.py compiles it with tools/rsrc_rebuild.py compile_rc (RC 5.2, toolchain/msvc7.0) and links the
// .res; the linked .rsrc is byte-identical to the retail one. RC numbers the icon images 1-6 and the cursor image 7 in
// statement order, as the retail table has them. The files under res/ are the retail leaves with their file headers
// (.ico/.cur directory, BITMAPFILEHEADER) put back; the names are ours.

LANGUAGE 0x9, 0x1

102 ICON "res/icon102.ico"

112 BITMAP "res/bitmap112.bmp"

104 CURSOR "res/cursor104.cur"
